---
import { clinic } from '../data/clinic';
---

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-brand-600 px-6 py-12 text-center text-white lg:px-16 lg:py-16">
    <div class="dot-pattern absolute inset-0 opacity-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative">
      <p class="heading-en text-brand-100">Contact</p>
      <h2 class="heading-jp">まずはお気軽にご相談ください</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-50">
        ご予約・ご相談はお電話が確実です。急な痛みなど当日のご連絡も、可能な限り対応いたします。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a href={clinic.telHref} class="btn bg-white text-brand-700 text-lg">
          <span aria-hidden="true">☎</span>
          <span class="tabular-nums">{clinic.tel}</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-accent">お問い合わせフォーム</a>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-brand-100">
        受付時間 {clinic.hours.time}／{clinic.hours.closedText}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
